flowchart LR
  A[Contract<br/>or agreement]:::people --> B[Budget lines with<br/>account codes]:::truway
  B --> C{Another person<br/>approves}
  C --> D[Field advance<br/>to a team]:::truway
  D --> E{Another person<br/>approves}
  E --> F[Purchase in the field<br/>receipt by WhatsApp]:::people
  F --> G[Expense filed<br/>against its line]:::truway
  G --> H{Another person<br/>approves}
  H --> I[Public record<br/>with its code]:::chain
  I --> J[Report per line<br/>and general ledger]:::truway

classDef chain fill:#1E42D8,stroke:#0B1F77,color:#FFFFFF
classDef ext fill:#F2F2F0,stroke:#8F9298,color:#272A30
classDef people fill:#FAF5E8,stroke:#C7A667,color:#332602
classDef soon fill:#FFFFFF,stroke:#8F9298,stroke-dasharray:5 4,color:#585B62
classDef truway fill:#F0F4FF,stroke:#243CA6,color:#111318
